@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor "Client" as Client
participant "CartView\n(UI)" as UI
participant "OrderService\n(Backend)" as Service
participant "OrderRepository\n(DB)" as DB

Client -> UI : Review cart & click Place Order
Note over UI: Fetch currentUser and cartProducts\nfrom VaadinSession attributes

UI -> Service : addOrderToDB(newOrder)
activate Service

Service -> DB : save(order)
activate DB
DB --> Service : confirm save success in MongoDB
deactivate DB

Service --> UI : return success confirmation
deactivate Service

Note over UI: Clear temporary session cart

UI -> Client : Display order success screen
@enduml